/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A bit tricky to make the flow right IMO, CC @Mickeon.\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t\t\tIf [code]false[/code], the [SubViewportContainer] is not available as a drop target in drag-and-drop operations, and instead the [Control] nodes inside its [Viewport] children are potential drop targets.\r\n\t\t\tIf [code]true[/code], the [SubViewportContainer] itself will be considered as a drop target in drag-and-drop operations, blocking the propagation to the [Control] nodes inside its [Viewport] children.\r\n```","created_at":"2024-11-19T09:18:41Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T09:18:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99270#discussion_r1847960423","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99270","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1847960423"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99270#discussion_r1847960423"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99270"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1847960423/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":24,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":25,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1848048560","pull_request_review_id":2444965915,"id":1848048560,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5uJvuw","diff_hunk":"@@ -3062,6 +3062,12 @@ void Viewport::_update_mouse_over(Vector2 p_pos) {\n \t\t\t}\n \t\t\tv->_update_mouse_over(v->get_final_transform().affine_inverse().xform(pos));\n \t\t}\n+\n+\t\tViewport *section_root = get_section_root_viewport();\n+\t\tif (section_root && c->is_consume_drag_and_drop_enabled()) {